**Assessing table design**

I’m realizing the table can be smaller, but the content area in the block could ideally have fully editable rows. The plan mentions “块内容区域” potentially includes row content, so it feels important to align expectations in my tests regarding the editor row. My previous test might not be accurate, so I should adjust the new assertion to ensure we don’t assume full row width within the editor. Plus, I’m leaning toward a top-right layout.
